        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mushroom Survivors</strong> is a fast-paced <strong>roguelike survival game</strong> where you battle hordes of deadly mushroom monsters using auto-casting magical attacks. Move strategically, collect magical upgrades, and survive the apocalypse one minute at a time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as one of the last remaining humans in a cursed world overrun by monstrous fungi. Unlock new heroes, harness different magical abilities, and fight your way through toxic forests, eerie ruins, and mysterious islands.<br><br>Story :<br>In a world overrun by a deadly mushroom plague, nearly all of humanity has perished only a few with rare immunity remain. But the infection did more than just kill... it transformed. From the ruins of civilization, monstrous mushroom creatures have emerged some mindless, others terrifyingly intelligent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These mushroom demons have formed clans, grouped by their eerie colors, and now roam the land capturing the last survivors. Yet, amidst the chaos, a forgotten power lingers <strong>magic</strong>. Ancient spellbooks still hold power, giving those who find them a fighting chance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are one of the immune one of the last hopes. Survive the nightmare, harness magical powers, and embark on a mission to rescue the remaining humans before they vanish forever into the spores.<br><br>🧠 <strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🪓 <strong>Auto-attacking weapons</strong> and unlockable skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧪 <strong>Level up</strong> to choose random upgrades in every run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💀 <strong>25 minutes per match</strong> survival challenge!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧟‍♂️ Face hordes of enemies, powerful elite monsters, and final bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏝️ Explore different themed islands: forest, beach, and abandoned roads</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 Simple controls, addictive gameplay loop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔄 Unlock new characters and permanent progression between runs<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896210/extras/1860f416e532189dc661ca0815cf3d0f.avif?t=1755769732\" width=200 height=264 /></span></p></li></ul>",
